led records of guests cover pages stained with ink, grease, and gods-know what else.] \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Name: <a href=\"/wiki/Bernyr\" title=\"Bernyr\">Bernyr</a>\n</p><p>Stay: Indefinite\n</p><p>Paid 'til: tenday hence\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Name: <a href=\"/wiki/Ffion_Goldgrind\" title=\"Ffion Goldgrind\">Ffion Goldgrind</a>\n</p><p>Stay: One Month\n</p><p>Paid 'til: <b>TENDAY LATE!</b>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Name: <a href=\"/wiki/Griska\" title=\"Griska\">Grishka</a>\n</p><p>Stay: Unsure\n</p><p>Paid 'til: five nights hence\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Name: <a href=\"/wiki/Rosanna\" title=\"Rosanna\">Rosanna</a>\n</p><p>Stay: \"Short as bloody possible\"\n</p><p>Paid 'til: two nights hence\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202713\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1348/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23720/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5875/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931097/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.258      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.258      1 -total\n 50.13%   23.188      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.19%   20.902     15 Template:Trim\n 24.18%   11.183      2 Template:Uid\n 18.12%    8.384      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.00%    6.016      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.36%    5.254      1 Template:Books\n 10.52%    4.866      1 Template:Icon_link\n  9.89%    4.574      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12837-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202713 and revision id 317803. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}